# Intentionally empty.
#
# config/env imports "dotenv/config", which would otherwise load apps/api/.env and
# let a developer's local settings change test behaviour — an AWS_REGION plus
# S3_BUCKET in that file would reroute document downloads through a presigned URL,
# and a MAIL_FROM would try to reach SES. env.setup.ts points DOTENV_CONFIG_PATH at
# this file so the suite sees only the variables it sets itself.
